[Boomshine Blowout - Heat Never Rises (MISSION-SPECIFIC)]
author=IRISHDEVELOPERDEV (from SLES-54622 MAIN.SCM / ELF analysis)
description=[PARTLY TESTED: holds heat at 0 in memory during the mission, mission pass not yet confirmed] [MISSION-SPECIFIC: enable only during Boomshine Blowout, then turn off] Only active while the Boomshine "Heat" bar is on screen. Freezes heat at 0. Disable after the mission.
